---
config:
  theme: mc
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: O2AT system overview
    accDescr: Audio crosses a duplex optical Ethernet link into a validated receiver buffer. The receiver audio clock controls conversion, while cumulative credits regulate source delivery over the return fibre.
    subgraph source["O2AT source (Transport)"]
        TX["Transport FPGA, Ethernet and 1G SFP"]
        MEDIA["Stored or generated audio"]
    end
    subgraph receiver["O2AT receiver (DAC)"]
        FIFO["Dual-clock audio FIFO"]
        RX["1G SFP and DAC-side FPGA validation"]
        DAC["Converter interface and D/A conversion"]
        CLOCK["Receiver audio clock"]
        ACCOUNT["Retired-group and buffer accounting"]
        CONTROL["Cumulative credits and status"]
    end
    MEDIA --> TX
    RX L_RX_FIFO_0@--> FIFO
    FIFO L_FIFO_DAC_0@--> DAC & ACCOUNT
    CLOCK L_CLOCK_FIFO_0@-. Read cadence .-> FIFO
    CLOCK L_CLOCK_DAC_0@-. Conversion timing .-> DAC
    ACCOUNT --> CONTROL
    TX L_TX_RX_0@== Fibre A: audio and forward control ==> RX
    CONTROL L_CONTROL_TX_0@-. Fibre B: return control .-> TX

    linkStyle 0,1,2,7 stroke:#087b83,stroke-width:2.5px,fill:none
    linkStyle 3,6,8 stroke:#bd6a27,stroke-width:2px,fill:none
    linkStyle 4,5 stroke:#4555a0,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:4 4,fill:none

    L_RX_FIFO_0@{ animation: slow }
    L_FIFO_DAC_0@{ animation: fast }
    L_FIFO_ACCOUNT_0@{ animation: slow }
    L_CLOCK_FIFO_0@{ animation: slow }
    L_CLOCK_DAC_0@{ animation: slow }
    L_TX_RX_0@{ animation: slow }
    L_CONTROL_TX_0@{ animation: fast }
